Maintainer: Sinexis <ops@sinexis.app>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: sinexis-host-protect
Architecture: all
Depends: wazuh-agent, python3
Recommends: clamav
Description: Sinexis Host Protect on-box helper (YARA/needles, optional Clam)
 Add-on for an enrolled wazuh-agent VM. Walks allowlisted web roots and
 POSTs JSON findings to the Sinexis Host Protect ingest API.
 Not a second enroll daemon.
 ClamAV is optional; skip scan if clamscan/clamdscan is absent.
